      <Docs>
        <summary>Gets the rate of perceived exertion (RPE) for this exercise segment.</summary>
        <value>Value is between 0.0f and 10.0f inclusive</value>
        <exception cref="T:Java.Lang.IllegalStateException">The rate of perceived exertion is not set.</exception>
        <remarks>
          <para>Gets the rate of perceived exertion (RPE) for this exercise segment.</para>
          <para>Values correspond to the Borg CR10 RPE scale and must be in the range 0 to 10 inclusive.
            0: No exertion (at rest) 1: Very light 2-3: Light 4-5: Moderate 6-7: Hard 8-9: Very hard 10:
            Maximum effort</para>
          <para>Use <see cref="P:Android.Health.Connect.DataTypes.ExerciseSegment.HasRateOfPerceivedExertion" /> to check whether RPE exists for this segment.</para>
          <para>
            <format type="text/html">
              <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/health/connect/datatypes/ExerciseSegment#getRateOfPerceivedExertion()" title="Reference documentation">Java documentation for <code>android.health.connect.datatypes.ExerciseSegment.getRateOfPerceivedExertion()</code>.</a>
